# THE LOOKS (0.17.2, a test): the Console and Ritual themes, the last two on Global > Theme. Console: five channel strips on the
# pages that showed the sigil, faders, the sequencer a tracker. Ritual: the whole screen one circle (no header, no knob strip), the
# page's knobs in its corners; the pages with a picture of their own keep the bands. Then back to Imp: the header and knobs again.
seed 0
wait 3000
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 10
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 10
expect playing 1
tap GLO
wait 100
spin K2 6
wait 200
expect theme 6
tap HOME
wait 4000
expect view 0
shot looks_console_home.png
tap ENV
wait 1500
expect view 1
shot looks_console_pad.png
press GLO
wait 100
tapkey 12
wait 100
release GLO
wait 1500
expect trkmute 32
shot looks_console_mute.png
press GLO
wait 100
tapkey 12
wait 100
release GLO
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
press SEQ
wait 500
release SEQ
wait 1200
expect view 35
shot looks_console_seq.png
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 100
spin K2 1
wait 200
expect theme 7
tap HOME
wait 4000
expect view 0
shot looks_ritual_home.png
turn K1 3
wait 300
shot looks_ritual_touch.png
tap ENV
wait 1500
expect view 1
shot looks_ritual_pad.png
press SEQ
wait 500
release SEQ
wait 1200
expect view 35
shot looks_ritual_seq.png
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 1500
shot looks_ritual_padenv.png
